id: you-can-do-it-mark
name: You Can Do It
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Desperate Support's, on an Ally, held on the supporter's clock.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Desperate Support: Stress Bonus 2 higher until the start of the supporter's next turn.
text: >
  You can do it!: The Ally has their Stress Bonus increased by 2 until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
stressBonus += 2;
